---
import SocialBar from './SocialBar.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="sx-section sx-soft" id="kontakt"><div class="sx-container">
 <p class="sx-eyebrow">Kontakt</p><h2>Im Gespräch beginnt die Zusammenarbeit.</h2>
 <div class="sx-grid">
  <div class="sx-footer-card"><h3>Sanexio GmbH</h3><p>Cortex und Nexus entstehen in der ärztlichen Praxis unseres Teams.</p><p>Grüneburgweg 12<br />60322 Frankfurt am Main</p><SocialBar variant="on-light" /></div>
  <div class="sx-footer-card"><h3>Direkter Draht</h3><p><a href="mailto:s.stracke@sanexio.de">s.stracke@sanexio.de</a><br /><a href="mailto:team@sanexio.de">team@sanexio.de</a><br /><a href="tel:+4969727819">069 727819</a></p><p><a href="https://westend-hausarzt.com">Zur Partnerpraxis</a></p></div>
 </div>
 <div class="sx-footer-bottom"><p>© {year} Sanexio GmbH · Frankfurt am Main</p><nav aria-label="Rechtliches"><a href="/impressum/">Impressum</a><a href="/datenschutz/">Datenschutz</a></nav></div>
</div></footer>
<style>
 .sx-footer-card { padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 2rem); background: var(--sx-c-surface); border: 1px solid var(--sx-c-line-soft, #E5E5EA); border-radius: var(--sx-radius-card); }
 footer a { text-decoration-color: var(--sx-c-accent-ring); text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px; }
 footer a[href^="mailto:"], footer a[href^="tel:"] { font-weight: 600; }
 .sx-footer-bottom { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--sx-c-line-soft, #E5E5EA); margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 2rem; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--sx-c-ink-muted); }
 .sx-footer-bottom p { margin: 0; } nav { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; } nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; text-decoration: none; }
 nav a:hover, nav a:focus-visible { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
